<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8574"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dpinva<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dpinva<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 6:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Embersage, <BR> <BR>I think you are correct, at least in the fact that Mr. Otero knew something was seriously endagering his family, and he probably knew what that danger was. Hopefully one day we will find out what it was.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
