<!--Post: 8577--><!--Time: 1109211187-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8577"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 6:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I believe the danger WAS btk, He knew the guy was unstable when he trained him, but back then, The death Squads were made up of nuts. <BR> <BR>Here is the coding problem I think we have. I believe everyone is right about the mailman, Telephone repair man, etc. The problem is that BTK can be anyone he wants to be at anytime, so to decode he, we have to figure out what identity, he had at what time. The one thing he can&#39;t change is his nationallity.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8577-->
<!--Post: 8579--><!--Time: 1109211460-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8579"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:nugzter@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Nugzter<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 6:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->ohhh, i see now your point. a profi!!! and joe trained him? but if joe was a trainer of such &#34;killers&#34; wouldnt joe know how to hide just as well as BTK has managed to do? Pluss if BTK was packin a .22 like he did with the Bright case, joe woulda whipped his ....you know what. i do think he had a grudge against Otero, but I think it more along personal lines. He did me wrong kinda thing.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8579-->
<!--Post: 8585--><!--Time: 1109213397-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8585"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 6:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Embersage, I like portions of your theory like thinking in codes and having so many identities that he doesn&#39;t know who he is anymore. Those are kind of intriging but I think you may be going with the Otero once trained BTK portion of your theory partly based on Charlie Otero&#39;s statements about a disturbing phone call and Joe Otero acting strange and protective and giving his son his ring based on that recolection.  <BR>Is there anyone else that can back up and corroborate those claims? Did any of Otero&#39;s co-workers also say he suddenly before his death was acting strangely and paranoid? Did he mention a phone call to anyone else? Were other relatives aware of any unusual behavior he displayed before his death like giving away things or telling them he had concerns for his family? Did any of Julie Otero&#39;s friends or her former co-workers have any indication from her that her husband had concerns over a possible threat to his family? If not why not? Why then only a 15 year old boy and no one else like a co-worker or an adult relative of Mr. Otero? <BR>If you could find that others were aware of a potential threat or concern to the Otero&#39;s then I would think you may be on to something. You may very well be but who besides Charlie Otero has backed up his claims?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8585-->
<!--Post: 8587--><!--Time: 1109215896-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8587"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 7:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I would be happy to help decode it, but its pointless unless we have &#34;creeps&#34; actual words. <BR>LE has given a watered down version, with all spelling and grammatical errors fixed. Its a waste of time. But I did have a couple thoughts. <BR> <BR>He may have written &#34;my father died in WWII&#34; I may take that as &#34;my father, WWII&#34;, like his initials were W.W. and he was the second.  <BR>  <BR>and &#34;my mother was &#39;forced to work&#39;&#34;, I might take that as &#34;my mother was  F.T.W.&#34; her initials were F.T.W. <BR> <BR>Ham radio clue=hogtied tortured and killed pigs for fun and practice. <BR> <BR>Cousin named Susan=had a cousin, but is referring to him as &#34;Sue&#39;s son&#34;. I feel the same about the clue Larry Anderson in MO ID Ruse, he could be refering to himself as he had heard himself introduced many times, for example, &#34;And this is Mrs. So and So, &#39;and her son, Larry&#39;&#34; <BR> <BR>Cousin moving to Missouri=cousin moved to St Louis Street. <BR> <BR>Admitting to frequenting prostitutes=he has frequently killed prostitutes <BR> <BR>Always lived by trains=always took his model train with him when the family moved <BR> <BR>Petra and Tina=Petra is the Rose Red City &#40;biblical&#41; related to Palestina <BR> <BR>thats all for now folks <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8587-->
<!--Post: 8597--><!--Time: 1109220219-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8597"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 8:43 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The biography info from BTK is paraphrased so don&#39;t put too much faith in it other than for basic information. Where did the Larry Anderson come from...I remember that name from surfing.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8597-->
<!--Post: 8613--><!--Time: 1109247804-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8613"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 4:23 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->FIRST OF ALL: GOOGLE LISTS ABOUT 1,000,000,000 <BR>LARRY ANDERSONS.  <BR> <BR>I REMEMBERED THE NAME FROM MY SURFING AND HAVE BEEN LOOKING FOR IT ALL NIGHT AND MY EYES ARE TOO TIRED TO MAKE SENSE OF ALL THE PUZZLES. <BR> <BR>BUT...AND THIS MIGHT MEAN NOTHING...I DID CATCH HIS NAME JUMBLED IN WITH DISEASE...SO IF YOU ARE FAMILIAR WITH THE PUZZLES... <BR> <BR>LARRY ANDERSON IS A HEAD MICROBIOLOGIST WITH THE CENTER FOR DISEASE CONTROL AND PREVENTION. HE IS PRESENTLY WORKING ON THE BIRD FLU AND SARS, BUT WAS ALSO INVOLVED IN WITH THE <BR> <BR>ANTHRAX CRISIS  <BR> <BR>AND WORKING ON A VACCINATION PLAN FOR <BR> <BR>SMALL POX <BR> <BR>PLEASE, AS YOU WORK THE PUZZLES, KEEP AN EYE PEELED FOR KEY WORDS LIKE MICRO, GERM, BUG, SICK, <BR>NAMES OF CONTAGIOUS DISEASES, STRAIN, OR ANYTHING GERMY OR DISEASY. OR POXY <BR> <BR>IF YOU FIND ANYTHING PLEASE POST UNDER &#34;POSSIBLE SUSPECTS&#34; &#34;STEVE HATFIELD&#34; &#40;which is supposed to be hatfill&#41;. THANK YOU.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8613-->
<!--Post: 8619--><!--Time: 1109253269-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8619"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 5:54 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->ok Nugz, yes he would know to hide, but there would not have been time, he may have been planning to leave or hide, but if it was BTK then when he called Joe, He said I am coming to Kansas, didn&#39;t say when, So when the telephone repairman came and Joe wouldn&#39;t let him in the house without an ID, or the day the electric went out, he hid the children in the closet until he made sure the electric was out in the neighborhood. I believe he was afraid, but what do you do. Call the police and say hey there is this guy, one of my former students in the death squads that I trained in Panama who is dangerous and might be coming to Kansas. <BR>I have been reading some old files from the Air Force in the 60-70&#39;s when William Cooper &#40;Writer of Behold a Pale Rider&#41; and from what I gather about teh CIA op. Joe wouldn&#39;t have been about to say anything with Death Squad in it. <BR>Johno, my point, is the above, I believe Joe was trying to find a way to protect his family, Like changing the morning schedule, I just dont think he had enough time. <BR>B. that is my point exactly, I think the things he tells us are made up, and a have been looking for that link to steve, I don&#39;t think it is him, but I do think that they may have been trained in thinking the same way, and may know each other. You know somewhere they have their own chat board for crazy people. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 8619-->
<!--Post: 8834--><!--Time: 1109364294-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8834"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 25, 2005 - 12:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If btk knew Joe from the Military is it possible that he knew the guy that Julie worked with, the one shot 4 days before from Coleman, from the Military also?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
